00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:24.000
(57:21) ٱللَّهُ ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ

00:38:24.000 --> 00:38:25.000
which is a very special name.

00:38:27.000 --> 00:38:33.000
Because the gematrical value of “Zul Fadl Al-‘Azim” is the same as the number of the word "Allah" in the whole Quran.

00:38:33.000 --> 00:38:35.000
So, we think there's something special about it.

00:38:36.000 --> 00:38:37.000
“Zul Fadl Al-‘Azim”

00:38:42.000 --> 00:38:43.000
Profound Fact

00:38:44.000 --> 00:38:52.000
[57:22] Anything that happens on earth, or to you, has already been recorded, even before the creation. This is easy for GOD to do.

00:38:53.000 --> 00:38:59.000
And we're told the reason, why is God telling us this? We're told the reason in 23.

00:38:59.000 --> 00:39:09.000
[57:23] Thus, you should not grieve over anything you miss, nor be proud of anything He has bestowed upon you. GOD does not love those who are boastful, proud.

00:39:11.000 --> 00:39:15.000
Edip: This is the key of happiness. Dr. Khalifa: Yes. Exactly.

00:39:15.000 --> 00:39:19.000
Dr. Khalifa: You have an even keel, nothing bothers you. Yes. Edip: Yes.

00:39:21.000 --> 00:39:31.000
