00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:43.000
If you love anything too much, then Satan will say "Aha!"

00:39:44.000 --> 00:39:50.000
Let me tell God that if you take this thing from him or from her, he or she will blaspheme against You.

00:39:50.000 --> 00:39:52.000
