00:44:36.000 --> 00:44:37.000
Dr. Khalifa: "When in their privacy."

00:44:38.000 --> 00:44:39.000
Edip: They don't see that.

00:44:40.000 --> 00:44:47.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes. There are people who are in this mosque and they say "We believe you're God's messenger." But they will not profess that outside.

00:44:47.000 --> 00:44:50.000
They're afraid that the people may ridicule them.

00:44:51.000 --> 00:44:52.000
They will hesitate to say it.

00:44:54.000 --> 00:44:56.000
So, "Bilghayb (بِٱلْغَيْبِ)" applies here.

00:44:56.000 --> 00:45:03.000
It's that even outside, even away from here or in their privacy, they have no

00:45:03.000 --> 00:45:08.000
